According to the graph, which city had the largest population in 1891?$qb$, $qb$https://nsvaeqcsrlrvsmynwfft.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/question-images/CB-239d3535.png$qb$, $qb$[{"label": "A", "body": "Toronto"}, {"label": "B", "body": "Montréal"}, {"label": "C", "body": "Québec City"}, {"label": "D", "body": "Halifax"}]$qb$::jsonb, 'B'::answer_option, null, $qb$Choice B is the best answer because the graph shows that Montréal had the largest population in 1891 among the four cities represented.
